/**
 * Case Hub view — reconstruction of the original Xcode Case Hub shell
 * (TPI-V2-WEB-014B, Stage C1).
 *
 * Original reference: `Cases/CaseDetailView.swift` (caseHubContent) and
 * `Workflow/CaseHub/PPCaseHubCardRegistry.swift`.
 *
 * The original hierarchy is preserved exactly:
 *   1. Case header / investigation status / baseline progress / session controls
 *   2. Workflow · Investigation Tools · Assistant & Case Support card sections
 *   3. Workflow readiness, checklist and activity detail
 *
 * All workflow information still comes from the authoritative workflow
 * services — no UI-computed truth. Card availability is honest (registry.ts).
 */
